WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.176 --> 00:00:01.593
- Oh, look!

00:00:01.593 --> 00:00:03.512
You're a genius.

00:00:04.503 --> 00:00:05.398
- I know.

00:00:05.398 --> 00:00:06.808
- Oh my god!

00:00:09.495 --> 00:00:11.620
- We had a lot of fun
trying on Santa stuff

00:00:11.620 --> 00:00:13.616
and pretending to be Santas,
breaking in Ned's house,

00:00:13.616 --> 00:00:15.497
but, the whole point of being Santa is

00:00:15.497 --> 00:00:17.076
to bring cheer to little kids.

00:00:17.076 --> 00:00:19.329
- Find somebody that has a want

00:00:19.329 --> 00:00:21.632
that you can help fill, whatever it is.

00:00:25.292 --> 00:00:26.674
- Have you two been good girls this year?

00:00:26.674 --> 00:00:27.770
- Yes.

00:00:30.846 --> 00:00:32.458
- What's your favorite kind of puppy?

00:00:32.458 --> 00:00:35.535
- My little favorite
puppy is the little one.

00:00:35.535 --> 00:00:37.513
- For my favorite
children across the world,

00:00:37.513 --> 00:00:40.334
we have puppies that kiss the
presents before they go out.

00:00:40.334 --> 00:00:42.308
To just give them a little
extra dose of magic.

00:00:42.308 --> 00:00:43.724
And, I'm gonna tell you, your presents

00:00:43.724 --> 00:00:45.326
will both have puppy kisses.

00:00:45.326 --> 00:00:47.102
- Listen to what they say,
maybe ask them a question

00:00:47.102 --> 00:00:49.315
about it, just interact with
them like you would anybody.

00:00:49.315 --> 00:00:50.469
- What's your favorite dinosaur?

00:00:51.717 --> 00:00:53.597
- Do you have little arms
like a tyrannosaurus?

00:00:53.597 --> 00:00:55.306
You have big arms for a tyrannosaurus!

00:00:55.306 --> 00:00:56.363
David, watch out!

00:00:56.363 --> 00:00:57.790
David, ho ho ho!

00:00:57.790 --> 00:00:59.068
Thank you, David.

00:00:59.068 --> 00:01:00.228
Good eye touch!

00:01:00.228 --> 00:01:03.269
- Violeta, I hear that
you really like science!

00:01:03.269 --> 00:01:04.200
- Mm hmm!

00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:07.287
It's mostly experiments
in science and art.

00:01:07.287 --> 00:01:08.703
- What's your favorite song?

00:01:08.703 --> 00:01:09.980
- The Titanic.

00:01:09.980 --> 00:01:12.523
- Mrs. Clause thinks
that Leonardo DiCaprio

00:01:12.523 --> 00:01:14.286
is very handsome.
- [Violetta] Yeah.

00:01:14.286 --> 00:01:16.621
- But, it's a movie based
on a horrible tragedy.

00:01:16.621 --> 00:01:17.747
- Yeah, they die.

00:01:17.747 --> 00:01:20.428
- You just want to talk
to them like real people.

00:01:20.428 --> 00:01:22.728
- Samia, I hear that you
like beauty and fashion.

00:01:22.728 --> 00:01:23.607
- I do.

00:01:23.607 --> 00:01:24.840
- What's your favorite thing?

00:01:24.840 --> 00:01:26.909
- I guess it would go to makeup.

00:01:26.909 --> 00:01:28.209
- What makeup would you put on me?

00:01:28.209 --> 00:01:30.346
- Red, darkish lipstick.

00:01:30.346 --> 00:01:31.669
- Yes girl.

00:01:31.669 --> 00:01:33.388
- How do you get onto a nice list?

00:01:33.388 --> 00:01:35.582
- Well, let's see, I got a million things.

00:01:35.582 --> 00:01:37.427
- Doing chores, doing your homework,

00:01:37.427 --> 00:01:39.203
being obedient to your parents.

00:01:39.203 --> 00:01:40.909
- I was being a lot good.

00:01:40.909 --> 00:01:42.582
- I clean up my room.

00:01:42.582 --> 00:01:45.251
- We help our mom when she's sick.

00:01:45.251 --> 00:01:49.047
- And, my sister, sometimes,
helps me with my product.

00:01:49.047 --> 00:01:50.743
- Yes, she's also a very good girl.

00:01:50.743 --> 00:01:52.469
- You know, there's nothing more rewarding

00:01:52.469 --> 00:01:53.709
then giving gifts.

00:01:53.709 --> 00:01:55.244
- What do you want for
Christmas this year?

00:01:57.820 --> 00:02:00.178
- American Girl doll, maybe
you haven't heard of it.

00:02:00.178 --> 00:02:01.339
Maybe you have.

00:02:01.339 --> 00:02:02.812
- Oh, Santa knows American Girl.

00:02:02.812 --> 00:02:04.194
Santa made American Girl doll.

00:02:04.194 --> 00:02:06.689
- Wow!

00:02:06.689 --> 00:02:07.815
- Yeah, I did that.

00:02:07.815 --> 00:02:09.093
- 2-in-1 computer.

00:02:09.093 --> 00:02:10.858
- Presents.

00:02:10.858 --> 00:02:11.657
- Presents!

00:02:11.657 --> 00:02:12.959
- What about you, Manuel?

00:02:12.959 --> 00:02:14.933
- I want robot!

00:02:14.933 --> 00:02:16.895
- Santa loves robots!

00:02:16.895 --> 00:02:19.251
(robotic noises)

00:02:19.251 --> 00:02:20.771
- Are you guys ready for your presents?

00:02:20.771 --> 00:02:21.757
- Yes.

00:02:21.757 --> 00:02:24.754
- When you give something
to someone and they feel

00:02:24.754 --> 00:02:27.829
touched and warmed and
loved by what you've done,

00:02:27.829 --> 00:02:32.503
it is, I think, the embodiment of love.

00:02:32.504 --> 00:02:37.504
(holiday music)

00:02:41.238 --> 00:02:42.722
- [Keith] Keep on, now, David!

00:02:43.215 --> 00:02:44.259
(gasps)

00:02:44.259 --> 00:02:45.653
(cheers)

00:02:45.653 --> 00:02:47.418
- Oh my gosh.

00:02:47.418 --> 00:02:49.877
- One, two, three!

00:02:49.877 --> 00:02:52.758
- (gasps) American Girl doll!

00:02:52.758 --> 00:02:54.138
- Tablet!

00:02:54.138 --> 00:02:55.450
- My computer!

00:02:55.450 --> 00:02:56.670
- Monster truck!

00:02:56.670 --> 00:02:57.900
- It's a monster truck!

00:02:57.900 --> 00:02:59.212
- Meccano!

00:03:01.260 --> 00:03:03.142
- You really did know what I want.

00:03:03.142 --> 00:03:05.428
- To have something to give
and to be able to experience

00:03:05.428 --> 00:03:08.910
the joy of giving, and to
see the people who receive,

00:03:08.910 --> 00:03:11.290
there's nothing more magical than that.

00:03:11.290 --> 00:03:13.229
- That was the cutest,
sweetest thing of all time.

00:03:13.229 --> 00:03:15.261
I've never seen a kid's
face light up like that.

00:03:15.261 --> 00:03:17.920
- I just have this bubbling joy feeling.

00:03:17.920 --> 00:03:20.369
- I have a huge respect for
all the people out there

00:03:20.369 --> 00:03:21.739
who are Santas.

00:03:21.739 --> 00:03:25.884
- We're all connected and
that is really what Christmas

00:03:25.884 --> 00:03:27.938
is about, what Santa Clause is about,

00:03:27.938 --> 00:03:29.460
and what the magic's about.

00:03:29.460 --> 00:03:32.385
It's that web between us
all that connects us all.

00:03:32.385 --> 00:03:34.079
- Can we get your sister to come up.

00:03:34.079 --> 00:03:35.506
- [Samia] She's scared!

00:03:35.506 --> 00:03:37.585
- Just caring about
someone else can really

00:03:37.585 --> 00:03:42.585
be the difference between
being lonely and being loved.

00:03:43.321 --> 00:03:46.722
I think, because you've been,
both been such good girls

00:03:46.722 --> 00:03:48.277
to your moms, you both
should have a present.

00:03:48.277 --> 00:03:50.141
So, we have a surprise for you, as well.

00:03:51.481 --> 00:03:52.479
(gasps)

00:03:54.819 --> 00:03:55.682
- It's okay.

00:03:55.682 --> 00:03:58.435
- It's, um, I don't know what to say--

00:03:58.435 --> 00:04:00.032
- You don't have to say anything.

00:04:00.032 --> 00:04:02.207
I think it's great that you
guys are such good girls

00:04:02.207 --> 00:04:03.183
for your families.

00:04:03.183 --> 00:04:06.212
You are studying and you're
gonna go a lot of great places

00:04:06.212 --> 00:04:08.273
in your life, and this is just
to help you along the way.

00:04:08.273 --> 00:04:09.065
- [Samia] That's--

00:04:09.065 --> 00:04:10.295
- You, even, don't really need this,

00:04:10.295 --> 00:04:11.671
but, this is something that you deserve.

00:04:11.671 --> 00:04:13.335
For me to be able to give
that to someone, today,

00:04:13.335 --> 00:04:18.335
just once, was a, was
really cool. (sniffles)

00:04:18.932 --> 00:04:21.891
We did a really good thing. (sniffles)

00:04:21.891 --> 00:04:23.076
Merry Christmas, Santa.

00:04:23.076 --> 00:04:24.846
- Merry Christmas, Santa.

